  _subtitle: Three knocks of the heels
  _description: Once worn by the [[f1b14b32-9a15-43bf-a44d-25040e68113a|Wicked Witch
    of the East]]. Whoever knocks the heels together three times can go anywhere
    in three steps. Only [[a8d31f11-20ef-48af-b122-17193b00af0d|Glinda]] knows their
    secret.
